From 208bd0f11c27e6d223d4690ee6f4cf21625d2ca9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ajensenwaud <ajensenwaud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 22:56:27 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 08/26] ling: YaRN for 1M context as transformers computes it
 (rope.zig: rope_scaling yarn only, inv_freq and attention factor, MLA mscale;
 TF_LING_YARN=auto|on|off, auto past the native window), attention rows capped
 by partials bytes for 1M positions; the TP=2 path (rank cuts on EXL3's
 128-wide blocks, one reduce a block, vocabulary-split head, GLM's step link
 and follower) under test

